         * DEF-002: Zero hardcoded hex/RGB colors; use semantic Tailwind tokens backed by 'tokens.css'.
         * DEF-003: Zero broken external URLs or icon font ligatures; use local SVG icons ('lucide-react') and inline SVG portraits.
         * DEF-004: ThePuffy AI Agent widget MUST be closed/docked by default.
